{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091450/extras/8fa6ddfbf4d373e3f6ff69523df8323f.avif?t=1772377080\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are There Bunny Girls in the Corner Store?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> Visual Novel / Card Battler / Slice of Life <strong>Setting:</strong> A modern city where customer service just got a whole lot cuter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Bunny Mart!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bunny girls are running the new local shop, and business is booming! Can you charm your way into their hearts before the rest of the town does?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grand opening of &quot;Bunny Mart&quot; has turned your quiet town upside down. The snacks are cheap, the drinks are cold, but let's be honest everyone is here for the clerks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You aren't the only one trying to get their attention. The shop is packed! If you want to stand out from the crowd, you can\u2019t just talk the talk. You\u2019ll need to <strong>play your cards right</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are There Bunny Girls in the Corner Store?</strong> mixes classic Visual Novel storytelling with a casual card battler.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Town:</strong> Use the city map to navigate your day. Will you head to the park to clear your head, or rush straight to the store to catch a specific girl on her shift?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card-Based Charm:</strong> Dialogue choices only go so far! Engage the girls in simple but strategic card games to win their attention. Build your stats, play the winning hand, and unlock special events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beat the Competition:</strong> The town is flocking to the shop. You need to prove you\u2019re not just another customer you\u2019re the Regular they\u2019ve been waiting for.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Staff</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc30 <strong>Akari (The Genki Girl):</strong> The bubbly front-desk face of the store. She believes a smile can fix anything. <i>Can you match her high energy?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091450/extras/fdda2686592a91c0e82102f0bd66f4cb.avif?t=1772377080\" width=300 height=400 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc30\u00a0<strong>Mina (The Gamer):</strong> Quiet, tech-savvy, and more comfortable with gadgets than customers. <i>She might ignore your texts, but she\u2019ll never turn down a game challenge.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091450/extras/d7fd1db31601e04aaa2f9f73f44dcd76.avif?t=1772377080\" width=300 height=400 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc30\u00a0<strong>Sakura (The Dreamer):</strong> A romantic soul who sees poetry in stocking shelves. <i>She wants a fairytale romance\u2014don't disappoint her.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091450/extras/c772becb096d4f489fc36d57d44ebd92.avif?t=1772377080\" width=300 height=400 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc30\u00a0<strong>Luna (The Boss):</strong> The sharp-tongued manager with a heart of gold (buried very, very deep). <i>She runs a tight ship. winning her over is the ultimate boss battle.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091450/extras/3026351ef51f181250f6119ae87c1dd4.avif?t=1772377080\" width=300 height=400 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4091450?t=1772377080","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4091450?t=1772377080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091450/5f368f1353e457d7fe3ccc9936c47ec282f6f79e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772377080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091450/5f368f1353e457d7fe3ccc9936c47ec282f6f79e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772377080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"All characters depicted are over the age of 21.\r\n-Risque outfits, sexual comments, and adult situations\r\n-Nudity \r\n-Sex Scenes \r\n-Adult Language "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091450/extras/8fa6ddfbf4d373e3f6ff69523df8323f.avif?t=1772377080\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are There Bunny Girls in the Corner Store?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> Visual Novel / Card Battler / Slice of Life <strong>Setting:</strong> A modern city where customer service just got a whole lot cuter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Bunny Mart!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bunny girls are running the new local shop, and business is booming! Can you charm your way into their hearts before the rest of the town does?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grand opening of &quot;Bunny Mart&quot; has turned your quiet town upside down. The snacks are cheap, the drinks are cold, but let's be honest everyone is here for the clerks.